{%- comment -%}
  The bag's summary panel — port of components/cart/order-summary.tsx.

  It shows what Shopify knows and says so about what it does not. Shipping is
  quoted by the courier app during checkout — Indonesian couriers are not native
  to Shopify — and tax is Shopify's to add, so there is no shipping selector here
  and the total is the subtotal. Putting a rate on this page would mean inventing
  one, and a checkout that then disagreed with it is worse than a line that says
  "calculated at checkout".

  TWO THINGS THE PORT CHANGES, both because Shopify is now actually connected:

  1. Checkout is real. The React version had `cart.checkoutUrl` as null and
     disabled the action with the reason beside it; here the button is a submit
     named `checkout` on the cart form, which is Shopify's own hand-off. The
     "checkout is not connected yet" sentence is deleted rather than kept,
     because it is now false.

  2. The promo field posts to checkout rather than reporting that it cannot
     apply anything. Shopify validates discount codes at checkout and nowhere
     else, so a code entered here rides along as ?discount= and is applied
     there. That is a real behaviour where the React version had an honest
     placeholder — but it does mean submitting the code moves you to checkout,
     which the design did not draw. The label says so.

  `isolate` on the wrapper is required: it is what keeps the aurora's soft-light
  blending against this panel rather than against the page.
{%- endcomment -%}

<aside aria-labelledby="summary-heading" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-inert p-6 md:p-9">
  {% render 'aurora', tone: 'inert', origin: 'top-right', intensity: 0.7 %}

  <div class="relative z-1 flex w-full flex-col gap-5">
    <h2 id="summary-heading" class="font-body text-micro uppercase tracking-label text-ink-subtle">
      {% render 'copy', value: section.settings.summary_heading, label: 'summary heading', inline: true %}
    </h2>

    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 text-small text-ink-body">
      <span>{{ section.settings.subtotal_label }}</span>
      {% render 'price', price: cart.total_price %}
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-t border-rule pt-5 text-small text-ink-body">
      <span>{{ section.settings.shipping_label }}</span>
      <span class="text-caption text-ink-muted">{{ section.settings.shipping_note }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <span class="font-display text-h2 leading-h2 text-ink">{{ section.settings.total_label }}</span>
      {% render 'price', price: cart.total_price, size: 'display' %}
    </div>

    <button
      type="submit"
      name="checkout"
      form="cart-form"
      class="inline-flex min-h-13 w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-invert bg-invert px-6 text-label uppercase tracking-label text-ink-invert transition-[background-color,color,border-color,transform] duration-(--duration-base) ease-out hover:border-invert-hover hover:bg-invert-hover active:translate-y-px"
    >{{ section.settings.checkout_cta }}</button>

    <form action="/checkout" method="get" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
      <label for="promo-code" class="sr-only">{{ 'cart.promo_code' | t }}</label>
      <input
        id="promo-code"
        type="text"
        name="discount"
        autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="{{ 'cart.promo_code' | t }}"
        class="min-h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-sm border border-line bg-canvas px-4 text-small text-ink placeholder:text-ink-subtle focus:border-brand"
      >
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="min-h-12 cursor-pointer rounded-sm border border-line px-5 text-micro uppercase tracking-nav text-ink-muted transition-colors duration-(--duration-base) hover:border-brand hover:text-brand"
      >{{ 'catalogue.apply' | t }}</button>
      <p class="w-full text-caption leading-snug text-ink-muted">{{ section.settings.promo_note }}</p>
    </form>

    <p class="text-caption leading-snug text-ink-subtle">{{ section.settings.tax_note }}</p>
  </div>
</aside>
